# Frontend

Same shape in `apps/web` and `apps/admin`:

```
src/pages/  src/hooks/  src/features/  src/components/{layout,ui}  src/api/  src/routes/  src/store/
```

- Chrome is **`Layout`**, never `Shell`. Gates are **`ProtectedRoute`** and **`GuestRoute`** under `components/layout/`.
- Errors: `ErrorBoundary` in `main.tsx`; `errorElement: <RouteError />` on the router (nested under `Layout`). Files in `src/components/`, not `routes/`.
- `router.tsx` wraps pages in `Layout`. Import pages from `@/pages`, hooks from `@/hooks`.
- Admin `ProtectedRoute` requires `user.role === 'admin'`. Admin `GuestRoute` redirects only if the session is already admin. Admin `Layout` may omit the sidebar on `/login`.
- Auth is Redux (`features/auth`) + `useAuth`. `App.tsx` calls `loadMe()`. `main.tsx` wraps `<Provider>`. No React auth context.
- Pages do not call axios. Hooks → slices → `api/`. Cross-folder imports use `@/` barrels; siblings use `./`.
- **Pages stay lean** — reuse `components/ui/` (`Card`, `PageHeader`, `Section`, `TextLink`, …). Do not copy long Bootstrap class strings onto every screen; use shared UI components.
- Tokens stay in cookies. Guest shop cart may use `localStorage`; admin does not.
